  "summary": "libdbi-perl vulnerabilities",
  "details": "Harsh Raj Singhania discovered that the Perl DBI module did not\ncorrectly validate certain attributes. An attacker could possibly use\nthis issue to execute arbitrary code. (CVE-2026-78030)\n\nHarsh Raj Singhania discovered that the Perl DBI module did not\ncorrectly handle certain string operations. An attacker could possibly\nuse this issue to cause a denial of service. (CVE-2026-88816)",
